commit 4a76b8de
author: 钛白
date: 2026-10-23 09:42:43 +0700
subject: fix(commandcode): correct quota display and connection test

Recognize the short plan ids the API actually returns ("go",
"individual-go-v1") so the Go plan resolves its name and 10-credit cap
instead of falling back to an unbounded "Command Code" row.

Quota rows now carry percentage/colorPercentage/percentageIsUsed plus an
emptyMessage, and the dashboard honours them: colours follow the
remaining share and an unused window reads "No usage in this window"
rather than a bare N/A.

Add a dedicated connection probe for commandcode hitting
/alpha/whoami?limits=1 — the generic key probes cannot validate a key
against this upstream.


